ZCL_COMMAND_PLANNED_COMMAND(
    "app.market.offer", "app.market", "", "Announce a file for sale",
    "Will announce a file for sale on the ZCL Market once an origin-announce "
    "path exists; today the handler is unbound and fails closed with exit 3 "
    "rather than reporting an announcement no peer receives.", 0,
    "market,offer,sell", "zcl.app_market_offer.input.v1",
    "zcl.app_market_offer_result.v1", "filepath,price_per_mb_zat", "",
    "zclassic23 app market offer --input='{\"filepath\":\"/data/f\",\"price_per_mb_zat\":1000}'",
    ZCL_COMMAND_LAYER_APP, ZCL_COMMAND_EFFECT_MUTATE, ZCL_COMMAND_RISK_APP_WRITE,
    ZCL_COMMAND_SCOPE_NODE, ZCL_COMMAND_AUTH_OWNER, ZCL_COMMAND_MODE_SYNC,
    ZCL_COMMAND_LATENCY_FOREGROUND, ZCL_COMMAND_COST_MODERATE,
    ZCL_COMMAND_CONFIRM_PLAN_COMMIT,
    ZCL_COMMAND_LANE_LOCAL | ZCL_COMMAND_LANE_ALL_NODE,
    ZCL_COMMAND_CAP_P2P_TOPIC, ZCL_COMMAND_TRAIT_NONE,
    "needs an origin-announce path before it can be exposed natively: "
    "rpc_zmarket_offer (file_market_controller.c) stats the file and calls "
    "file_market_add_offer + db_file_offer_save, then answers "
    "status=announced, but the only MSG_FILE_LIST writer in the tree is the "
    "re-gossip branch of handle_zfilelist (msgprocessor.c) — nothing ever "
    "announces a LOCALLY created offer, so no peer learns of it. Its "
    "root_hash is also SHA3(filepath:size), not a hash of the file contents")

ZCL_COMMAND_PLANNED_COMMAND(
    "app.market.buy", "app.market", "", "Buy and download a market file",
    "Will pay for and download a file by its SHA3 root hash once the purchase "
    "path is wired end to end; today the handler is unbound and fails closed "
    "with exit 3, so no funds move and no half-started session is left "
    "behind.", 0,
    "market,buy,download", "zcl.app_market_buy.input.v1",
    "zcl.app_market_buy_result.v1", "root_hash", "root_hash",
    "zclassic23 app market buy --input='{\"root_hash\":\"<64hex>\"}'",
    ZCL_COMMAND_LAYER_APP, ZCL_COMMAND_EFFECT_MUTATE, ZCL_COMMAND_RISK_WALLET,
    ZCL_COMMAND_SCOPE_NODE, ZCL_COMMAND_AUTH_OWNER, ZCL_COMMAND_MODE_SYNC,
    ZCL_COMMAND_LATENCY_FOREGROUND, ZCL_COMMAND_COST_MODERATE,
    ZCL_COMMAND_CONFIRM_PLAN_COMMIT,
    ZCL_COMMAND_LANE_LOCAL | ZCL_COMMAND_LANE_ALL_NODE,
    ZCL_COMMAND_CAP_WALLET_REQUEST, ZCL_COMMAND_TRAIT_NONE,
    "needs the payment leg wired before a spend leaf can be exposed "
    "natively: rpc_zmarket_buy (file_market_controller.c) only calls "
    "file_market_start_download, which allocates an in-memory session in "
    "state FDL_CHALLENGING. No code path sends MSG_FILE_CHAL, and nothing "
    "builds or broadcasts the payment transaction whose mempool-verified "
    "txid handle_zfilepay (msgprocessor.c) requires to unlock chunks, so the "
    "session never advances and no funds move")

